{"title":"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9ebddb0fab049d3dd6dd14cf48b679be118f295f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z(z+i)(z+3i)=2002i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"191\" height=\"20\" /> has a zero of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/615e780fda439b2829922a704a60b31c5ed77191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+bi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive real numbers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45ef9cdc7c7d46920eac603663914e0d9261a99b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/9/6296bedb2f8d74e924945f0d632456465bac7062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\sqrt{118} \\qquad \\text{(B) }\\sqrt{210} \\qquad \\text{(C) }2 \\sqrt{210} \\qquad \\text{(D) }\\sqrt{2002} \\qquad \\text{(E) }100 \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"526\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/274a4637f71ab9e01081d83e83ddd1c7ff012e20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002 = 11 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" />. With this observation, it becomes easy to note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a64cee06fc90e33cfe944c2e45d82639df229ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = -14i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> is a root of the given equation. However, it is not of the desired form in the problem, so we must factor the given expression to obtain the other 2 roots. From this point onwards, we assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d18905e2fb0973963b8bfcc84fdf05e9be0570c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z \\neq -14i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9ebddb0fab049d3dd6dd14cf48b679be118f295f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z(z+i)(z+3i)=2002i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"191\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/7/6e7e7b51cd1a39b99d117b8c5626c293548d6df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^3 + 4iz^2 - 3z - 2002i = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />. We may factor it as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4dfdb7f59975fca897021491180b711db265351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(z + 14i)(z^2 - 10iz - 143) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"241\" height=\"21\" />. Since \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c816117bcf512c4ce2521bbb961951b97b7babd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z + 14i \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/eca0af68ed5823538a28ad7acced3a7a2893709e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2 - 10iz - 143 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/00869d1ee98bac2c8b330c216ae327bc57ab6b13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac {10i \\pm \\sqrt{-100 + 4(143)}}{2} = 5i \\pm \\sqrt {118}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"322\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/5/d25634d7212302efdeb3702974863759bfb74d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />, we ignore the negative root. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80d2dad45318affb51469e92c340b0d1de9d3981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\boxed {\\text{(A) } \\sqrt {118}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"120\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P\">2002 AMC 12P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12P_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12P Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" wi